---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SMETA / Sedex Audit Services in India | Eurocert"
  description="Explore SMETA 2-Pillar and 4-Pillar audit services in India, audit requirements, CAPR reporting and cost factors. Request a quote from Eurocert."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/sedex/"
  ogImage="https://www.eurocert.asia/sedex.png"
  keywords="SMETA audit,Sedex audit,SMETA 2-Pillar,SMETA 4-Pillar,Sedex AAC,SMETA audit cost India,SMETA CAPR,Sedex approved audit company,Eurocert,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,social audits,certification body,India"
  heroImage="/sedex.png"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>

<!-- SECTION 1 — HERO -->
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img src="/Sedex imagery .jpg" alt="SMETA Sedex Audit Services" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]/55"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/90 via-[#030a16]/75 to-[#030a16]"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(3,10,22,0.75)_0%,rgba(3,10,22,0.35)_55%,transparent_100%)]"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Independent Social Compliance Audits</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-5 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.85),0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.35)">SMETA / Sedex Audit <span class="text-eurogold-400">Services in India</span></h1>
    <p class="text-white text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-3" style="text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)">Has your buyer requested a SMETA audit? Contact Eurocert to discuss your facility, buyer requirements and the appropriate 2-Pillar or 4-Pillar audit scope.</p>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8" style="text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)">EUROCERT SA is a Sedex-approved Affiliate Audit Company. SMETA audits assess workplace practices and produce an audit report &#8212; not a certification.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
      <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Request a SMETA Audit Quote <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a>
      <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all" href="/contact/">Discuss Your Audit Requirements</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 2 — OFFICIAL VERIFICATION PANEL -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-6 items-stretch">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
        <div class="text-left">
          <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Official Verification</h4>
          <h2 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-5">Verify EUROCERT SA&#8217;s <span class="text-euro-600">Sedex AAC Status</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT SA appears on Sedex&#8217;s official list of approved Affiliate Audit Companies (AACs). Only Sedex-approved AACs and their authorized auditors can conduct SMETA audits.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">You can verify the listing directly on Sedex&#8217;s website.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20 text-center" href="https://www.sedex.com/about/who-we-work-with/affiliate-auditors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Sedex&#8217;s Approved Audit Company Directory <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt text-[9px]"></i></a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-auto pt-6 text-slate-400 text-[12px] leading-relaxed">Sedex membership and SMETA audits are not certifications or guarantees of compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40 min-h-[200px]">
        <img src="/Sedex AAC logo.png" alt="Sedex AAC logo" class="w-full max-w-none object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 3 — OVERVIEW -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Overview</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Is a <span class="text-euro-600">SMETA Audit?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">SMETA stands for Sedex Members Ethical Trade Audit. It is a social-audit methodology used to assess working conditions and responsible business practices at a site.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The assessment considers the ETI Base Code, applicable local law and relevant international labour principles. Auditors review records, interview workers and management, and observe workplace conditions.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Businesses often call this a &#8220;Sedex audit.&#8221; More precisely, SMETA is the audit methodology, while Sedex provides the platform through which members can share audit information.</p>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-white">
        <h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Sedex and SMETA: What Is the Difference?</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li>Sedex is a membership organisation and responsible-sourcing platform.</li>
          <li>SMETA is the audit methodology owned and maintained by Sedex.</li>
          <li>Joining Sedex does not certify a business. Completing a SMETA audit also does not produce a certificate or a pass/fail result.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 4 — AUDIT OPTIONS -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Audit Options</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">SMETA 2-Pillar and <span class="text-euro-600">4-Pillar Audits</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 w-full aspect-[4/3] bg-white flex items-center justify-center p-4">
          <img src="/Sedex imagery 6.jpg" alt="SMETA 2-Pillar and 4-Pillar audits" class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 w-full aspect-[4/3] bg-white flex items-center justify-center p-4">
          <img src="/Sedex imagery .jpg" alt="SMETA audit services" class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-white text-sm"></i></div>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">SMETA 2-Pillar Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The two main assessment areas are:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Labour standards</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Health and safety</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Additional requirements within the methodology include basic environmental checks and relevant management practices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-white text-sm"></i></div>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">SMETA 4-Pillar Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The four assessment areas are:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Labour standards</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Health and safety</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Environment</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Business ethics</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A 4-Pillar audit includes extended environmental assessment and business ethics alongside the two core pillars.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40 text-center">
        <h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Which Audit Scope Do You Need?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-5">Confirm your buyer&#8217;s requirements before booking. Share the buyer&#8217;s request with our team so the proposed scope matches the requirement.</p>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Discuss 2-Pillar and 4-Pillar Options <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 5 — AUDIT COVERAGE -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Audit Coverage</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Does a SMETA <span class="text-euro-600">Audit Check?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6">Depending on the agreed scope, the audit reviews:</p>
      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Employment and recruitment practices</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Wages, benefits and working hours</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Worker rights and treatment</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Workplace health and safety</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Relevant policies and management systems</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Environmental practices</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Business ethics</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Evidence that procedures are followed in daily operations</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The assessment combines document review, interviews and site observations. Preparing documents alone is not a substitute for appropriate workplace practices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[340px] md:h-[440px] group">
        <img src="/Sedex imagery 2.jpg" alt="SMETA on-site audit assessment" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 6 — PROCESS -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Process</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">The SMETA <span class="text-euro-600">Audit Process</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">01</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Review your requirements</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Share your facility details, buyer instructions and requested audit scope.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">02</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Confirm Sedex membership</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">An active Sedex account is required for full and follow-up SMETA audits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">03</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Agree the audit arrangements</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Confirm the site scope, quotation, required audit time and scheduling arrangements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">04</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Conduct the site audit</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The audit team reviews records, conducts interviews and assesses workplace conditions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">05</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Document the findings</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Findings are recorded in the SMETA audit report and Corrective Action Plan Report (CAPR).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">06</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Share the report and address findings</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reports are shared through the Sedex Platform under the applicable access arrangements. The facility addresses findings, with verification or follow-up where required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 7 — REPORTING -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 lg:order-2 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Reporting</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">SMETA Audit <span class="text-euro-600">Report and CAPR</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The SMETA report records the site assessment and findings. The CAPR documents relevant findings and corrective-action requirements.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">These outputs help buyers and suppliers understand risks and track improvements. They do not certify the facility or guarantee acceptance by every buyer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 lg:order-1 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[300px] md:h-[380px] group">
        <img src="/Sedex imagery 3.jpg" alt="SMETA audit report and CAPR" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 8 — COST -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Cost</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">SMETA Audit <span class="text-euro-600">Cost in India</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-5">Audit costs depend on the facility location, workforce, site scope, required audit duration, 2-Pillar or 4-Pillar scope, and any follow-up requirements.</p>
      <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40 mb-5">
        <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-4">For a facility-specific quotation, provide:</h3>
        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Company and facility name</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Facility location</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Products or activities</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Approximate workforce and shifts</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Buyer&#8217;s requirements</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Sedex membership status</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Preferred audit period</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6">The quotation should distinguish audit charges from Sedex membership and any applicable platform-related charges.</p>
